cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and credit its sources."
type: dataset
title: "Morocco communes"
abstract: >-
  Morocco's régions, provinces and préfectures, cercles, communes and arrondissements,
  with official HCP geographic codes, names in French and Arabic, population from the
  2014 and 2024 censuses, and boundaries from OpenStreetMap.
authors:
  - given-names: Ousama
    alias: zkousama
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/zkousama/morocco-communes-api"
license:
  - MIT
  - ODbL-1.0
keywords:
  - Morocco
  - Maroc
  - communes
  - census
  - RGPH 2024
  - administrative divisions
references:
